Extract ONLY plot structure and world state logic.

STRICT RULES:
- JSON ONLY
- Do not include NPC or area descriptions
- Plot must support branching and failure
- Avoid linear scripting

ID RULES (MANDATORY):
- All IDs must be lowercase ASCII
- Format: <entity>.<slug>[.<context>]
- Slugs use underscores only
- IDs must be stable and deterministic
- If a collision occurs, append .2, .3, etc
- Never reuse an ID for a different entity

Return EXACTLY:

{
  "threads": [
    {
      "id": "string",
      "description": "string",
      "entry_conditions": ["string"],
      "resolution_conditions": ["string"]
    }
  ],
  "plot_branches": [
    {
      "id": "string",
      "trigger": "string",
      "outcomes": ["string"]
    }
  ],
  "consequences": [
    {
      "id": "string",
      "condition": "string",
      "effects": ["string"]
    }
  ],
  "world_state": {
    "flags": [
      {
        "id": "string",
        "description": "string",
        "default": false
      }
    ]
  }
}

